        "question":  "A 16-year-old male suffers from irritable mood, increased energy, decreased need for sleep, and pressured speech. He was recently started on medication by his psychiatrist to control these symptoms. He comes into your office complaining of a significant worsening of his acne since starting this new medication. What drug was he started on?",
