        "question":  "A 25-year-old man is brought to see you because of a change in personality after a boating accident. He fell off of his boat and landed head first on the dock. He was previously friendly, happy, and high-functioning. Now his speech is pressured and his mood is labile. He has been irresponsible at work and has been fired from his job. His memory is intact. Which one of the following brain areas did he damage?",
