        "isMultiSelect":  false,
        "answerText":  "",
        "explanation":  "A type I error occurs when the null hypothesis is rejected when it should have been retained. It is the equivalent of saying that a true difference exists between two samples when the difference is due solely to chance. Statistics K\u0026S Chapter 5",
