        "explanation":  "Within an hour of PCP intoxication, patients may develop vertical or horizontal nystagmus, hypertension or tachycardia, numbness or diminished responsiveness to pain, ataxia, dysarthria, muscular rigidity, seizures or coma, or hyperacusis. Depressed reflexes are often seen with inhalant intoxication. Conjunctival injection is often seen with cannabis intoxication. Slurred speech and memory impairment are often associated with alcohol intoxication. Substance-Related and Addictive Disorders K\u0026S Chapter 20",
