        "question":  "Which one of the following is not a characteristic of transient global amnesia?",
        "choices":  [
                        "Loss of personal information and identity",
                        "Reversible anterograde and retrograde memory loss",
                        "Inability to learn newly acquired information",
                        "Preservation of alertness without motor or sensory deficits",
                        "Men are affected more commonly than women"
                    ],
