        "explanation":  "In pyromania the patient sets fires repeatedly because of the tension before the act and the relief after. There is also a fascination with fire and its various uses. If the patient is setting fires for gain, such as money or to make a political statement, then it is not a case of pyromania. One cannot make the diagnosis in the presence of conduct disorder, mania, or antisocial personality disorder. Pyromania is included in the impulse control disorders. Disruptive, Impulse Control, Conduct Disorders, and ADHD K\u0026S Chapter 19",
