        "question":  "Which one of the following agents is the best choice for treating attention deficit hyperactivity disorder in a patient with Tourette\u0027s syndrome?",
        "choices":  [
                        "Bupropion",
                        "Methylphenidate",
                        "Dextroamphetamine",
                        "Atomoxetine",
                        "Clonidine"
                    ],
