        "answerText":  "",
        "explanation":  "Heroin can be detected on a urine toxicology screen for 36 to 72 hours. Alcohol can be detected for up to 12 hours. Amphetamines can be detected for up to 48 hours. Cannabis can be detected for up to 4 weeks. PCP can be detected for up to 8 days. Substance Abuse and Addictive Disorders K\u0026S Chapter 5",
