        "explanation":  "The amygdala is necessary for the recall of emotional contexts of specific events and the experience of fear, pleasure, or other emotions associated with these events. Declarative or episodic memory (also known as short-term memory) requires the intact functioning of the hippocampus and parahippocampal areas (nucleus basalis of Meynert) of the medial temporal lobe for storage and retrieval of information. The other answers are distractors. Basic Neuroscience B\u0026D Chapter 6",
