        "explanation":  "Clomipramine is one of the TCAs. It has been useful in the treatment of patients with premature ejaculation, depression, panic, OCD, phobias, and pain disorder. It has no use in treating psychosis. It carries with it the cardiac, autonomic, neurologic, sedative, and anticholinergic effects found with many of the TCAs. All TCAs should be avoided during pregnancy. Psychopharmacology K\u0026S Chapter 29",
