        "explanation":  "Adverse effects of fluoxetine that set it apart from other serotonin-selective reuptake inhibitors include headache, anxiety, and respiratory complaints. Other side effects include nausea, diarrhea, and insomnia. High blood pressure is found with patients on venlafaxine. Blurred vision can occur from anticholinergic medications. Shuffling gait can occur as a result of parkinsonian side effects of antipsychotics. Loss of consciousness occurs with sedatives. Psychopharmacology K\u0026S Chapter 29",
