        "explanation":  "The most important take-home point from this question is that bipolar I disorder has equal prevalence for men and women. Major depression is more common in women than in men. There is no correlation between socioeconomic status and frequency of depression. There is a correlation between hypersecretion (not hyposecretion) of cortisol and increased depression. Only about 50% of those with major depressive disorder receive specific treatment. Bipolar Disorders K\u0026S Chapter 8",
