        "explanation":  "The hippocampus is one of the most important structures in the formation of memory. Other areas important to memory include some of the diencephalic nuclei and the basal forebrain. The amygdala also plays a role by rating the emotional content of memories, thereby leading to stronger recall of more emotionally charged memories. Basic Neuroscience K\u0026S Chapter 1",
