        "explanation":  "Blocking the H1 receptor leads to weight gain and sedation. You should also be familiar with the effects of blocking some other receptors. Blocking acetylcholine receptors leads to dry mouth, constipation, blurry vision, urinary retention, and cognitive dysfunction. Blocking 1 adrenergic receptors leads to orthostatic hypotension and drowsiness. Blocking dopamine receptors can lead to extrapyramidal syndrome (EPS) and elevated prolactin. Basic Neuroscience K\u0026S Chapter 1",
