        "question":  "A television news program reports that a famous actress has been seen in public exhibiting verbal outbursts and unexplained violent behavior directed at people and property. A well-known psychiatrist appears on the program and, when asked about the actress, states she is probably suffering from bipolar disorder and possibly substance abuse. Which of the following best qualifies the ethics of the psychiatrist\u0027s on-air affirmations?",
