        "explanation":  "Lamotrigine has FDA approval for bipolar maintenance, and its efficacy has been demonstrated for both mania and depression. Topiramate is approved for seizures and migraines but is used off-label for mania. Carbamazepine is approved for treatment of acute mania. Valproic acid has been demonstrably effective for acute mania. Gabapentin is approved for seizures, postherpetic neuralgia, and neuropathic pain. Psychopharmacology K\u0026S Chapter 29",
