        "answerText":  "",
        "explanation":  "Appropriate specifiers for substance-induced anxiety disorder in DSM 5 include \"with onset during intoxication,\" \"with onset during withdrawal,\" and \"with onset after medication use.\" Though some may think this question is picky or unfair, the details of the DSM are indeed fair game for a test of general psychiatric knowledge. The small details of the DSM give the test writer ample opportunity to form tricky questions. Know your DSM well! Anxiety Disorders K\u0026S Chapter 9",
