        "question":  "Anterior capsulotomy and/or cingulotomy have been demonstrated to be effective in cases of treatment failure with which of the following severe disorders?",
        "choices":  [
                        "Tourette\u0027s syndrome",
                        "Schizophrenia",
                        "Bipolar disorder",
                        "Antisocial personality disorder",
                        "Obsessive-compulsive disorder"
                    ],
