        "isMultiSelect":  false,
        "answerText":  "",
        "explanation":  "When treating social anxiety disorder, combining CBT and pharmacotherapy does not show a clear benefit over using just one or the other for most initial treatments. There is evidence, however, that there are some refractory cases that do respond better to a combination of both. Anxiety Disorders K\u0026S Chapter 9",
