        "answerText":  "Interferon",
        "explanation":  "Interferon is well known to exacerbate depression. Side effects include depressed mood, suicidality, suicidal ideation, insomnia, fatigue, and cognitive inefficiency. The other medications listed are not known to cause the exacerbation of depressive symptoms listed in this question. Psychopharmacology K\u0026S Chapter 29",
