        "explanation":  "For a seizure to be effective in the course of ECT, it should last at least 25 seconds. Proper objective seizure monitoring must be undertaken by the physician conducting the ECT. There must be evidence that a bilateral generalized seizure has taken place after the electrical stimulation has been applied. The electroencephalogram (EEG) and electromyogram enable this to be monitored objectively. K\u0026S Chapter 29",
